    'natal:ruler10|house|12': 'With the 10th house ruler in the 12th house, the career may develop in quiet areas or away from the spotlight — such as research, institutional work, or spiritual service. There is an invitation to integrate the spiritual dimension into professional life, finding purpose beyond external recognition.',
