    'natal:ruler10|house|5': 'The 10th house ruler in the 5th house indicates that creative talents may gain public visibility and impact on the professional path. Children or artistic projects may be sources of fulfillment and recognition throughout life.',
    'natal:ruler10|house|6': 'With the 10th house ruler in the 6th house, work quality and health carry a strong influence on public image and professional achievements. Dedication to responsibilities and technical excellence tend to be progressively recognized.',
    'natal:ruler10|house|7': 'The 10th house ruler in the 7th house points to the importance of partnerships and strategic collaborations in building the professional trajectory. The quality of professional relationships and the contracts signed may have a significant impact on public positioning.',
    'natal:ruler10|house|8': 'With the 10th house ruler in the 8th house, the career may involve transformation, complex finances, or work with other people s resources. There is a potential to stand out in areas that require depth, research, or crisis management.',
    'natal:ruler10|house|9': 'The 10th house ruler in the 9th house suggests that reputation may be built through teaching, publishing, law, or international activities. A career that includes travel or that connects different cultures may bring genuine fulfillment.',
    'natal:ruler11|house|1': 'The 11th house ruler in the Ascendant indicates an open, sociable personality inclined toward groups and communities. The network of friendships and collective ideals tend to have a notable influence on how you perceive and present yourself to the world.',
    'natal:ruler11|house|10': 'With the 11th house ruler in the 10th house, social networks and influential friendships may have a visible impact on the professional trajectory and reputation. Associations, organizations, and strategic contacts tend to open relevant doors in the field of public achievements.',
    'natal:ruler11|house|11': 'The 11th house ruler in its own house emphasizes friendships, groups, and collective ideals as central themes of life. There is a natural inclination toward networking, participation in community causes, and the building of long-term bonds.',
    'natal:ruler11|house|12': 'With the 11th house ruler in the 12th house, friendships or group participation may have a quieter or more spiritual dimension. There is a potential for working in communities connected to healing, contemplation, or silent service away from more visible networks.',
