    'natal:ruler12|house|10': 'With the 12th house ruler in the 10th house, the career may develop in areas of service, research, or institutional work away from the spotlight. There is a dimension of purpose that goes beyond external recognition, and the most meaningful work may happen behind the scenes.',
    'natal:ruler12|house|11': 'The 12th house ruler in the 11th house indicates that friendships and group participation may involve more subtle dynamics that call for discernment. Cultivating circles of genuine trust and being selective with loyalties tends to be an important learning throughout life.',
    'natal:ruler12|house|12': 'With the 12th house ruler in its own house, inner life, spirituality, and contact with the invisible are central and deeply formative themes. Retreats, contemplative practices, and silent service may be the most authentic expressions of this configuration.',
