    'natal:ruler1|house|12': 'The Ascendant ruler in the 12th house suggests that an important part of personal development happens inwardly and quietly. Periods of withdrawal, spiritual reflection, or behind-the-scenes work may be essential to renew energy and clarify life direction.',
