    'natal:ruler1|house|5': 'With the Ascendant ruler in the 5th house, vitality and personal expression find their most natural channel in creative activities, romance, and pleasure. You may feel most like yourself when engaged in artistic projects, childcare, or experiences that bring genuine joy.',
